  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(6, 9, 324)\n\n(5, 8, 240)\n\n**Logic: **Third no. = [(First no.) × (Second no.) × 6]\n\n(6, 9, 324) →\n\n⇒ [(6) × (9) × (6)]\n\n⇒ (54 × 6) = 324\n\n(5, 8, 240) →\n\n⇒ [(5) × (8) × (6)]\n\n⇒ (40 × 6) = 240\n\nChecking all the given options:\n\n**1. (10, 6, 360) →**\n\n⇒ [(10) × (6) × (6)]\n\n⇒ (60 × 6) = **360**\n\n**2. (9, 4, 232) →**\n\n⇒ [(9) × (4) × (6)]\n\n⇒ (36 × 6) = 216\n\n**3. (8, 5, 280) →**\n\n⇒ [(8) × (5) × (6)]\n\n⇒ (40 × 6) = 240\n\n**4. (9, 5, 260) →**\n\n⇒ [(9) × (5) × (6)]\n\n⇒ (45 × 6) = 270\n\nHere, **(10, 6, 360)** shows a similar relation to the given set of numbers.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (1)\".",
